# ART-ALL03 -- W3-FIX-A acceptance: ALL03 (URBAN night, Washington DC). The
# White House, Jefferson and Lincoln Memorials and the Washington Monument
# (isogen.mix cg* art) stand in their lots; the 15 invisible light posts are
# not drawn but light the streets (LightSourceClass, FUN_00479440).
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL03U.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
assert art.invisible >= 10
cheat view_building CAWASH01
wait 2
shot whitehouse
cheat view_building CAWSH12
wait 2
shot monument
cheat view_building CAWASH14
wait 2
shot jefferson
cheat view_building CAWASH15
wait 2
shot lincoln
cheat view_building INYELWLAMP 3
wait 2
shot lamps
